   "description": "Khung môn học theo syllabus FLM chính thức.",
   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">DTG111 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.1</span>\n<h2>Course profile, as the university publishes it</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Visual Design Tools 1 — the official numbers: credits, hours, prerequisite and the decision that issued this syllabus.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 13451 · Decision 932/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 22/08/2025 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">DTG111 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.1</span>\n<h2>Hồ sơ môn học, đúng như trường công bố</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Visual Design Tools 1 — các con số chính thức: tín chỉ, giờ học, môn tiên quyết và quyết định ban hành syllabus.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 13451 · QĐ 932/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 22/08/2025 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Subject code</span><span class=\"v\">DTG111</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Syllabus name</span><span class=\"v\">Visual Design Tools 1_Công cụ thiết kế trực quan 1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Credits</span><span class=\"v\">3</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Degree level</span><span class=\"v\">Bachelor</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Time allocation</span><span class=\"v\">Study hour (150h)<br><br>= 45h contact hours + 105h self-study</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Prerequisite</span><span class=\"v\">None</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Teaching method</span><span class=\"v\">Lecture,Practice,discussion</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Scoring scale</span><span class=\"v\">10</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Minimum average to pass</span><span class=\"v\">5</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Syllabus ID</span><span class=\"v\">13451</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Decision</span><span class=\"v\">932/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 08/22/2025</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Approved date</span><span class=\"v\">8/22/2025</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Sessions in the plan</span><span class=\"v\">60</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Mã môn</span><span class=\"v\">DTG111</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Tên syllabus</span><span class=\"v\">Visual Design Tools 1_Công cụ thiết kế trực quan 1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Số tín chỉ</span><span class=\"v\">3</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Bậc đào tạo</span><span class=\"v\">Bachelor</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Phân bổ thời gian</span><span class=\"v\">Study hour (150h)<br><br>= 45h contact hours + 105h self-study</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Môn tiên quyết</span><span class=\"v\">None</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Phương pháp dạy – học</span><span class=\"v\">Lecture,Practice,discussion</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Thang điểm</span><span class=\"v\">10</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Điểm trung bình tối thiểu để qua</span><span class=\"v\">5</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Syllabus ID</span><span class=\"v\">13451</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Quyết định ban hành</span><span class=\"v\">932/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 08/22/2025</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Ngày duyệt</span><span class=\"v\">8/22/2025</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Số buổi trong kế hoạch</span><span class=\"v\">60</span></div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Description (verbatim)</h3>\n<p>The course empowerC14ommon Adobe 2D tools for Multimedia designers, which are Illustrator, Photoshop, InDesign and Xd, so that they can finalize their 2D designs better and able to deliver completed professional product to customers<br><br>Through practical assignments, students have chances to apply knowledge on colors, typography etc. in other courses along with computers and other tools to creaate graphic applications. In addition, students will be introduced to the application of AI tools in design workflows, developing AI literacy to enhance creativity and collaboration. The course also emphasizes the cultivation of a professional attitude and working style, preparing students for real-world design projects and industry practices.</p>\n<h3>Note from the university</h3>\n<p>5</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Mô tả môn học (nguyên văn)</h3>\n<p>The course empowerC14ommon Adobe 2D tools for Multimedia designers, which are Illustrator, Photoshop, InDesign and Xd, so that they can finalize their 2D designs better and able to deliver completed professional product to customers<br><br>Through practical assignments, students have chances to apply knowledge on colors, typography etc. in other courses along with computers and other tools to creaate graphic applications. In addition, students will be introduced to the application of AI tools in design workflows, developing AI literacy to enhance creativity and collaboration. The course also emphasizes the cultivation of a professional attitude and working style, preparing students for real-world design projects and industry practices.</p>\n<h3>Ghi chú của trường</h3>\n<p>5</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13451\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13451</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13451\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13451</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
